Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Have you ever looked up at the night sky and\Nwondered what's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.22,0:00:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Let me tell you about our amazing solar system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}a bit like a giant cosmic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}playground where each planet has its own\Nspecial spot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Right at the center
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}we have the Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It's like the heart of this playground
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}spreading light and warmth to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Imagine it as a big
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.93,0:00:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}friendly campfire keeping us warm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Close to the Sun are the inner planets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}These are like rocky marbles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}solid and strong
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}We have Mercury
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.57,0:00:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Venus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.27,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}and Mars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}They're like neighbors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}huddling close together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Earth is where we live
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}with its oceans and mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Mars is often called the Red Planet because of its\Nrusty color
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}a little farther out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}we have the outer planets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}These are like giant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}soft gas balls floating in space
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Jupiter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Saturn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Uranus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}and Neptune are here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Jupiter is so big
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}it's like a giant bouncy ball that can hold over 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}300 Earths
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}inside it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}And don't forget Earth's best friend
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}the Moon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}It follows us around and helps make the ocean\Ntides go up and down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:00:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}just like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}magic
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.59,0:01:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Every planet in this cosmic neighborhood moves\Naround the Sun in a big
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}swirling
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}dance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.81,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}This dance is why we have days and nights and\Nhow we know what's nighttime or
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}daytime here on Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}Next time you see the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HCC&}remember all these playful planets and how they
